---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
---

<Layout title="About" description="Everything you need to know about Open Boxing" img={null}>
	<main>
		<Breadcrumbs route={[["About", `${Astro.url.origin}/about/`]]} />

		<h1 class="my-8 text-3xl xl:mx-auto xl:max-w-240">About</h1>

		<div class="xl:mx-auto xl:max-w-240">
			<p class="my-4">Boxing's many titles are hard to follow. Open Boxing's goal is to make it easier.</p>
			<p class="my-4">We provide timelines that give you an overview of weight classes, world titles and world champions.</p>
			<p class="my-4">We publish newspaper articles that have fallen into the public domain to give significant bouts and events context.</p>
			<p class="my-4">
				Open Boxing is in very early development. One of our goals is to verify every bout and reign with a reference, but until then expect some mistakes. We provide an <a
					class="underline"
					href={`${Astro.url.origin}/api/`}>API</a
				> to explore our data.
			</p>
			<p class="my-4">
				Found a mistake or want to make a suggestion to improve Open Boxing? Please raise an issue on <a
					class="underline"
					href="https://github.com/edhwright/open-boxing/issues"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a
				>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>